    },
    {
      "key": "available-kittens-4",
      "html": "<section aria-label=\"Apply for a kitten\" class=\"border-y border-kar-champagne bg-kar-blush-pale\"><div class=\"container py-10 sm:py-12\"><div class=\"mx-auto flex max-w-3xl flex-col items-center gap-5 text-center\"><a class=\"inline-flex min-h-[44px] items-center justify-center rounded-kar border border-kar-gold bg-kar-chocolate px-8 py-3.5 font-londrinaSolid tracking-wide text-kar-ivory-bright shadow-kar-btn transition-colors duration-300 hover:bg-kar-chocolate-soft focus-visible:outline-none focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-kar-gold focus-visible:ring-offset-2 focus-visible:ring-offset-kar-ivory\" href=\"/adoption-process\" id=\"btn-apply-kitten-midpage\">Apply for a Kitten</a><p class=\"text-sm text-kar-chocolate-soft\">Deposits are non-refundable, and apply toward the total. <a class=\"text-kar-gold-text underline underline-offset-2 transition-colors duration-300 hover:text-kar-chocolate focus-visible:outline-none focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-kar-gold\" href=\"/adoption-process\">See pricing, payment and go-home details</a>.</p></div></div></section>"
    },
    {
      "key": "why-choose-heading",
      "html": "<section aria-labelledby=\"why-choose-heading\" class=\"bg-kar-ivory py-12 sm:py-16\"><div class=\"container\"><div class=\"text-center\"><p class=\"text-[11px] font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.24em] text-kar-rose\">Every kitten nurtured with love and care</p><h2 class=\"mt-4 font-serif text-2xl text-kar-chocolate sm:text-3xl\" id=\"why-choose-heading\">Why Choose Us</h2></div><ul class=\"mt-9 grid grid-cols-1 gap-6 sm:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-4\"><li class=\"flex h-full flex-col rounded-[20px] border border-kar-champagne bg-kar-ivory-bright p-6 shadow-kar-soft\"><span class=\"flex h-11 w-11 items-center justify-center rounded-full border border-kar-champagne-deep bg-kar-cream\"><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"lucide lucide-house text-kar-gold-deep\" fill=\"none\" height=\"20\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"2\" viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\" width=\"20\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><path d=\"M15 21v-8a1 1 0 0 0-1-1h-4a1 1 0 0 0-1 1v8\"></path><path d=\"M3 10a2 2 0 0 1 .709-1.528l7-5.999a2 2 0 0 1 2.582 0l7 5.999A2 2 0 0 1 21 10v9a2 2 0 0 1-2 2H5a2 2 0 0 1-2-2z\"></path></svg></span><h3 class=\"mt-5 font-serif text-lg leading-snug text-kar-chocolate\">Home-Raised &amp; Socialized</h3><p class=\"mt-3 text-sm leading-relaxed text-kar-chocolate-soft\">All Ragdolls are raised in a loving, cage-free environment, well-socialized with children, other cats, and dogs.</p></li><li class=\"flex h-full flex-col rounded-[20px] border border-kar-champagne bg-kar-ivory-bright p-6 shadow-kar-soft\"><span class=\"flex h-11 w-11 items-center justify-center rounded-full border border-kar-champagne-deep bg-kar-cream\"><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"lucide lucide-shield-check text-kar-gold-deep\" fill=\"none\" height=\"20\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"2\" viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\" width=\"20\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><path d=\"M20 13c0 5-3.5 7.5-7.66 8.95a1 1 0 0 1-.67-.01C7.5 20.5 4 18 4 13V6a1 1 0 0 1 1-1c2 0 4.5-1.2 6.24-2.72a1.17 1.17 0 0 1 1.52 0C14.51 3.81 17 5 19 5a1 1 0 0 1 1 1z\"></path><path d=\"m9 12 2 2 4-4\"></path></svg></span><h3 class=\"mt-5 font-serif text-lg leading-snug text-kar-chocolate\">DNA-Tested Breeding Cats</h3><p class=\"mt-3 text-sm leading-relaxed text-kar-chocolate-soft\">Our kittens come from TICA-registered breeding cats that are DNA-tested and carefully selected for temperament and the Ragdoll look.</p></li><li class=\"flex h-full flex-col rounded-[20px] border border-kar-champagne bg-kar-ivory-bright p-6 shadow-kar-soft\"><span class=\"flex h-11 w-11 items-center justify-center rounded-full border border-kar-champagne-deep bg-kar-cream\"><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"lucide lucide-stethoscope text-kar-gold-deep\" fill=\"none\" height=\"20\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"2\" viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\" width=\"20\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><path d=\"M11 2v2\"></path><path d=\"M5 2v2\"></path><path d=\"M5 3H4a2 2 0 0 0-2 2v4a6 6 0 0 0 12 0V5a2 2 0 0 0-2-2h-1\"></path><path d=\"M8 15a6 6 0 0 0 12 0v-3\"></path><circle cx=\"20\" cy=\"10\" r=\"2\"></circle></svg></span><h3 class=\"mt-5 font-serif text-lg leading-snug text-kar-chocolate\">Clean &amp; Nurturing Space</h3><p class=\"mt-3 text-sm leading-relaxed text-kar-chocolate-soft\">We provide a safe, clean, and enriching environment so kittens grow healthy, confident, and happy.</p></li><li class=\"flex h-full flex-col rounded-[20px] border border-kar-champagne bg-kar-ivory-bright p-6 shadow-kar-soft\"><span class=\"flex h-11 w-11 items-center justify-center rounded-full border border-kar-champagne-deep bg-kar-cream\"><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"lucide lucide-heart text-kar-gold-deep\" fill=\"none\" height=\"20\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"2\" viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\" width=\"20\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><path d=\"M19 14c1.49-1.46 3-3.21 3-5.5A5.5 5.5 0 0 0 16.5 3c-1.76 0-3 .5-4.5 2-1.5-1.5-2.74-2-4.5-2A5.5 5.5 0 0 0 2 8.5c0 2.3 1.5 4.05 3 5.5l7 7Z\"></path></svg></span><h3 class=\"mt-5 font-serif text-lg leading-snug text-kar-chocolate\">Ready for Loving Homes</h3><p class=\"mt-3 text-sm leading-relaxed text-kar-chocolate-soft\">Each kitten receives veterinary care, spay/neuter as appropriate, and is fully prepared to join your family.</p></li></ul></div></section>"
    },
    {
      "key": "application-process-heading",
      "html": "<section aria-labelledby=\"application-process-heading\" class=\"border-y border-kar-champagne bg-kar-cream py-12 sm:py-16\"><div class=\"container\"><h2 class=\"text-center font-serif text-2xl text-kar-chocolate sm:text-3xl\" id=\"application-process-heading\">Kitten Adoption Process</h2><ol class=\"mx-auto mt-9 grid max-w-5xl grid-cols-1 gap-6 md:grid-cols-3\"><li class=\"flex h-full flex-col rounded-[20px] border border-kar-champagne bg-kar-ivory p-6 shadow-kar-soft\"><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"flex h-10 w-10 items-center justify-center rounded-full border border-kar-champagne-deep bg-kar-accent font-londrinaSolid text-lg text-kar-dark\">1</span><h3 class=\"mt-5 font-serif text-lg leading-snug text-kar-chocolate\">Submit a Kitten Application</h3><p class=\"mt-3 text-sm leading-relaxed text-kar-chocolate-soft\">To be considered for adoption, all prospective families must complete a Kitten Application. We review each application carefully to ensure our kittens go to loving forever homes.</p></li><li class=\"flex h-full flex-col rounded-[20px] border border-kar-champagne bg-kar-ivory p-6 shadow-kar-soft\"><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"flex h-10 w-10 items-center justify-center rounded-full border border-kar-champagne-deep bg-kar-accent font-londrinaSolid text-lg text-kar-dark\">2</span><h3 class=\"mt-5 font-serif text-lg leading-snug text-kar-chocolate\">Reserve Your Kitten</h3><p class=\"mt-3 text-sm leading-relaxed text-kar-chocolate-soft\">Our kittens are <strong class=\"font-semibold text-kar-chocolate\">$4,500</strong>. If your application is approved, you'll get access to our available kittens and can place a <strong class=\"font-semibold text-kar-chocolate\">$1,000 deposit</strong> to reserve yours — the deposit applies toward the total, with the $3,500 balance due before pickup.</p></li><li class=\"flex h-full flex-col rounded-[20px] border border-kar-champagne bg-kar-ivory p-6 shadow-kar-soft\"><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"flex h-10 w-10 items-center justify-center rounded-full border border-kar-champagne-deep bg-kar-accent font-londrinaSolid text-lg text-kar-dark\">3</span><h3 class=\"mt-5 font-serif text-lg leading-snug text-kar-chocolate\">Stay in the Loop</h3><p class=\"mt-3 text-sm leading-relaxed text-kar-chocolate-soft\">Once your application is approved, stay connected every step of the way. Follow us on social media, subscribe to our blog for breed tips and cattery updates, or join our newsletter for kitten availability alerts straight to your inbox.</p></li></ol><p class=\"mt-8 text-center text-sm text-kar-chocolate-soft\">Deposits are non-refundable, and apply toward the total. <a class=\"text-kar-gold-text underline underline-offset-2 transition-colors duration-300 hover:text-kar-chocolate focus-visible:outline-none focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-kar-gold\" href=\"/adoption-process\">See pricing, payment and go-home details</a>.</p></div></section>"
    },
    {
      "key": "service-area-heading",
      "html": "<section aria-labelledby=\"service-area-heading\" class=\"bg-kar-ivory py-12 sm:py-16\"><div class=\"container\"><div class=\"mx-auto max-w-3xl text-center\"><h2 class=\"font-serif text-2xl text-kar-chocolate sm:text-3xl\" id=\"service-area-heading\">Where We Serve</h2><p class=\"mt-3 font-serif text-lg italic text-kar-rose sm:text-xl\">Serving Austin, Texas and surrounding areas</p></div><ul class=\"mt-6 grid grid-cols-1 gap-5 sm:grid-cols-2\"><li class=\"rounded-[20px] border border-kar-champagne bg-kar-cream p-6\"><h3 class=\"text-[11px] font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.16em] text-kar-chocolate\">IN-PERSON PICKUP</h3><p class=\"mt-2 text-sm leading-relaxed text-kar-chocolate-soft\">Visit us in Austin, Texas, and meet our cats.</p></li><li class=\"rounded-[20px] border border-kar-champagne bg-kar-cream p-6\"><h3 class=\"text-[11px] font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.16em] text-kar-chocolate\">FLIGHT NANNY SERVICE</h3><p class=\"mt-2 text-sm leading-relaxed text-kar-chocolate-soft\">Personal care all the way to you with our trusted flight nannies.</p></li></ul></div></section>"
    },
    {
      "key": "buyer-faq-heading",
      "html": "<section aria-labelledby=\"buyer-faq-heading\" class=\"border-y border-kar-champagne bg-kar-cream py-12 sm:py-16\"><div class=\"container\"><div class=\"mx-auto max-w-3xl\"><h2 class=\"text-center font-serif text-2xl text-kar-chocolate sm:text-3xl\" id=\"buyer-faq-heading\">Frequently Asked Questions</h2><div class=\"mt-8\"><div class=\"accordian space-y-3\" data-accordion-type=\"single\"><details class=\"ease-in-out accordion-item overflow-hidden rounded-kar border transition-colors duration-300 border-kar-champagne-deep bg-kar-blush\"><summary class=\"flex flex-1 items-center justify-between transition-all cursor-pointer min-h-[56px] gap-4 px-4 py-4 text-left text-sm font-semibold text-kar-chocolate hover:no-underline sm:text-base focus-visible:outline-none focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-inset focus-visible:ring-kar-gold\"><span class=\"flex items-center gap-4\"><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"hidden h-8 w-8 shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-full border text-xs font-semibold transition-colors duration-300 sm:flex border-kar-rose bg-kar-ivory-bright text-kar-rose\">1</span><span class=\"font-serif text-base leading-snug sm:text-lg\">How much are your kittens?</span></span><svg class=\"lucide lucide-chevron-down h-4 w-4 shrink-0 transition-transform duration-200\" fill=\"none\" height=\"24\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"2\" viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\" width=\"24\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><path d=\"m6 9 6 6 6-6\"></path></svg></summary><p class=\"transition-all duration-300 ease-in-out mx-3 mb-3 mt-0 rounded-lg bg-kar-ivory-bright px-4 py-3 text-kar-chocolate-soft [&amp;_a]:font-semibold [&amp;_a]:text-kar-rose [&amp;_a]:underline [&amp;_a]:underline-offset-2 hover:[&amp;_a]:text-kar-chocolate [&amp;_strong]:text-kar-chocolate text-sm sm:text-[15px]\">$4,500 per kitten, flat — the same price regardless of color, pattern, sex or eye color. A $1,000 non-refundable deposit reserves your kitten, and the $3,500 balance is due before pickup.</p></details><details class=\"ease-in-out accordion-item overflow-hidden rounded-kar border border-kar-champagne bg-kar-ivory transition-colors duration-300\"><summary class=\"flex flex-1 items-center justify-between transition-all cursor-pointer min-h-[56px] gap-4 px-4 py-4 text-left text-sm font-semibold text-kar-chocolate hover:no-underline sm:text-base focus-visible:outline-none focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-inset focus-visible:ring-kar-gold\"><span class=\"flex items-center gap-4\"><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"hidden h-8 w-8 shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-full border border-kar-champagne-deep bg-kar-ivory-bright text-xs font-semibold text-kar-gold-text transition-colors duration-300 sm:flex\">2</span><span class=\"font-serif text-base leading-snug sm:text-lg\">How do I adopt a Ragdoll kitten?</span></span><svg class=\"lucide lucide-chevron-down h-4 w-4 shrink-0 transition-transform duration-200\" fill=\"none\" height=\"24\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"2\" viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\" width=\"24\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><path d=\"m6 9 6 6 6-6\"></path></svg></summary><p class=\"transition-all duration-300 ease-in-out mx-3 mb-3 mt-0 rounded-lg bg-kar-ivory-bright px-4 py-3 text-kar-chocolate-soft [&amp;_a]:font-semibold [&amp;_a]:text-kar-rose [&amp;_a]:underline [&amp;_a]:underline-offset-2 hover:[&amp;_a]:text-kar-chocolate [&amp;_strong]:text-kar-chocolate text-sm sm:text-[15px]\">To adopt a Ragdoll kitten from Astrid Moon Cattery, submit a Kitten Application through our website. Once approved, you can reserve your kitten and complete the adoption agreement.</p></details><details class=\"ease-in-out accordion-item overflow-hidden rounded-kar border border-kar-champagne bg-kar-ivory transition-colors duration-300\"><summary class=\"flex flex-1 items-center justify-between transition-all cursor-pointer min-h-[56px] gap-4 px-4 py-4 text-left text-sm font-semibold text-kar-chocolate hover:no-underline sm:text-base focus-visible:outline-none focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-inset focus-visible:ring-kar-gold\"><span class=\"flex items-center gap-4\"><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"hidden h-8 w-8 shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-full border border-kar-champagne-deep bg-kar-ivory-bright text-xs font-semibold text-kar-gold-text transition-colors duration-300 sm:flex\">3</span><span class=\"font-serif text-base leading-snug sm:text-lg\">What age are the kittens available for adoption?</span></span><svg class=\"lucide lucide-chevron-down h-4 w-4 shrink-0 transition-transform duration-200\" fill=\"none\" height=\"24\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"2\" viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\" width=\"24\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><path d=\"m6 9 6 6 6-6\"></path></svg></summary><p class=\"transition-all duration-300 ease-in-out mx-3 mb-3 mt-0 rounded-lg bg-kar-ivory-bright px-4 py-3 text-kar-chocolate-soft [&amp;_a]:font-semibold [&amp;_a]:text-kar-rose [&amp;_a]:underline [&amp;_a]:underline-offset-2 hover:[&amp;_a]:text-kar-chocolate [&amp;_strong]:text-kar-chocolate text-sm sm:text-[15px]\">Families usually meet the kittens and choose around 6-8 weeks. Early spay/neuter is done at approximately 11-12 weeks, and kittens go home at 12 weeks or older, once they have recovered from surgery and been cleared by our veterinarian, with microchipping and age-appropriate vaccinations complete. Some kittens stay longer when they need it.</p></details><details class=\"ease-in-out accordion-item overflow-hidden rounded-kar border border-kar-champagne bg-kar-ivory transition-colors duration-300\"><summary class=\"flex flex-1 items-center justify-between transition-all cursor-pointer min-h-[56px] gap-4 px-4 py-4 text-left text-sm font-semibold text-kar-chocolate hover:no-underline sm:text-base focus-visible:outline-none focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-inset focus-visible:ring-kar-gold\"><span class=\"flex items-center gap-4\"><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"hidden h-8 w-8 shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-full border border-kar-champagne-deep bg-kar-ivory-bright text-xs font-semibold text-kar-gold-text transition-colors duration-300 sm:flex\">4</span><span class=\"font-serif text-base leading-snug sm:text-lg\">Are deposits refundable?</span></span><svg class=\"lucide lucide-chevron-down h-4 w-4 shrink-0 transition-transform duration-200\" fill=\"none\" height=\"24\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"2\" viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\" width=\"24\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><path d=\"m6 9 6 6 6-6\"></path></svg></summary><p class=\"transition-all duration-300 ease-in-out mx-3 mb-3 mt-0 rounded-lg bg-kar-ivory-bright px-4 py-3 text-kar-chocolate-soft [&amp;_a]:font-semibold [&amp;_a]:text-kar-rose [&amp;_a]:underline [&amp;_a]:underline-offset-2 hover:[&amp;_a]:text-kar-chocolate [&amp;_strong]:text-kar-chocolate text-sm sm:text-[15px]\">Deposits are non-refundable. They never expire and are applied toward the total adoption fee once your application is approved. If you cancel, the deposit is forfeited, but at our discretion it may be applied toward a future kitten from us.</p></details><details class=\"ease-in-out accordion-item overflow-hidden rounded-kar border border-kar-champagne bg-kar-ivory transition-colors duration-300\"><summary class=\"flex flex-1 items-center justify-between transition-all cursor-pointer min-h-[56px] gap-4 px-4 py-4 text-left text-sm font-semibold text-kar-chocolate hover:no-underline sm:text-base focus-visible:outline-none focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-inset focus-visible:ring-kar-gold\"><span class=\"flex items-center gap-4\"><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"hidden h-8 w-8 shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-full border border-kar-champagne-deep bg-kar-ivory-bright text-xs font-semibold text-kar-gold-text transition-colors duration-300 sm:flex\">5</span><span class=\"font-serif text-base leading-snug sm:text-lg\">How do I pay, and what payment methods do you accept?</span></span><svg class=\"lucide lucide-chevron-down h-4 w-4 shrink-0 transition-transform duration-200\" fill=\"none\" height=\"24\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"2\" viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\" width=\"24\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><path d=\"m6 9 6 6 6-6\"></path></svg></summary><p class=\"transition-all duration-300 ease-in-out mx-3 mb-3 mt-0 rounded-lg bg-kar-ivory-bright px-4 py-3 text-kar-chocolate-soft [&amp;_a]:font-semibold [&amp;_a]:text-kar-rose [&amp;_a]:underline [&amp;_a]:underline-offset-2 hover:[&amp;_a]:text-kar-chocolate [&amp;_strong]:text-kar-chocolate text-sm sm:text-[15px]\">We accept three payment methods: <strong>Zelle</strong> (to astridmooncattery@gmail.com; confirm the recipient name with us before sending), <strong>cash</strong> in person at pickup, and a <strong>cashier's check</strong> (email us to confirm the payee name). We do not accept credit cards, personal checks, Venmo, Cash App, or PayPal. A $1,000 deposit reserves your kitten and the $3,500 balance is due before your kitten goes home — a flat $4,500 total per kitten. Deposits are non-refundable and apply toward the total. Because cash is in person and a cashier's check must arrive first, Zelle is the only method that can secure a deposit remotely.<br/><br/>Zelle limits vary by bank — check yours before sending. Most banks will raise your daily limit if you call them, though some decline requests for pet purchases. If your limit is lower than the amount due, email me at astridmooncattery@gmail.com and we'll work out timing that works for your bank — split payments across days, or cash or a cashier's check instead.<br/><br/>I confirm every deposit by email within 24 hours. If you don't hear from me, email astridmooncattery@gmail.com.</p></details><details class=\"ease-in-out accordion-item overflow-hidden rounded-kar border border-kar-champagne bg-kar-ivory transition-colors duration-300\"><summary class=\"flex flex-1 items-center justify-between transition-all cursor-pointer min-h-[56px] gap-4 px-4 py-4 text-left text-sm font-semibold text-kar-chocolate hover:no-underline sm:text-base focus-visible:outline-none focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-inset focus-visible:ring-kar-gold\"><span class=\"flex items-center gap-4\"><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"hidden h-8 w-8 shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-full border border-kar-champagne-deep bg-kar-ivory-bright text-xs font-semibold text-kar-gold-text transition-colors duration-300 sm:flex\">6</span><span class=\"font-serif text-base leading-snug sm:text-lg\">Do you ship kittens?</span></span><svg class=\"lucide lucide-chevron-down h-4 w-4 shrink-0 transition-transform duration-200\" fill=\"none\" height=\"24\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"2\" viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\" width=\"24\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><path d=\"m6 9 6 6 6-6\"></path></svg></summary><p class=\"transition-all duration-300 ease-in-out mx-3 mb-3 mt-0 rounded-lg bg-kar-ivory-bright px-4 py-3 text-kar-chocolate-soft [&amp;_a]:font-semibold [&amp;_a]:text-kar-rose [&amp;_a]:underline [&amp;_a]:underline-offset-2 hover:[&amp;_a]:text-kar-chocolate [&amp;_strong]:text-kar-chocolate text-sm sm:text-[15px]\">We don't ship kittens as cargo. For families outside driving distance we arrange a flight nanny, who carries your kitten in the cabin as their own carry-on and hands them to you the same day. Closer to home, we offer pickup in Austin, Texas, or — depending on your location — we can meet partway or arrange ground delivery for a fee.</p></details></div></div><div class=\"mt-8 text-center\"><a class=\"inline-flex min-h-[44px] items-center gap-2 rounded-kar text-[13px] font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.16em] text-kar-gold-text underline underline-offset-4 transition-colors duration-300 hover:text-kar-chocolate focus-visible:outline-none focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-kar-gold focus-visible:ring-offset-2 focus-visible:ring-offset-kar-cream\" href=\"/faq\" id=\"link-all-faqs-available-kittens\">See all FAQs <span aria-hidden=\"true\">→</span></a></div></div></div></section>"
